---
// EstateIntro — 2-column layout: headline + intro copy left, supporting
// image right. Standard section, always rendered.
---

<section id="estate-intro" class="intro w-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="wrap intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow on-light">The Release</span>
      <h2>A boutique release of twenty.</h2>
      <p>
        Pacific Fairways is a boutique release of just 20 acreage-style lots
        in Springwood, offering the rare combination of space and convenience
        only 22km from Brisbane CBD. Set alongside Pacific Fairway Golf
        Course, it's built for buyers who want room to breathe without giving
        up city access. With generous 1,000m² lots, it's ideal for lifestyle
        seekers and those looking to build their forever home.
      </p>
      <div class="intro-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm" href="#lot-stage-detail">View Available Lots</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="plate hatch plate-intro reveal">
      <div class="plate-corner"></div>
      <span class="plate-tag">Plate 01 — Estate Aerial · Pending</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }
  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
  .intro-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 34px);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .intro-copy p {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 52ch;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .intro-actions {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .plate-intro {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }
</style>
